{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17412","headline":"顺宗至德大安孝皇帝挽歌三首 三 · 权德舆","name":"顺宗至德大安孝皇帝挽歌三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"候晓传清跸，迎风引彩旒。\n共瞻宫辂出，遥想望陵愁。\n弓劒随云气，衣冠奉月游。\n空余驾龙处，摇落鼎湖秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17412.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17412","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}